Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.78,0:00:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,duty, the authority must\Nrecover the entire House
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Rent Allowance drawn before\Naccepting the resignation.
